@title Rayman 3 (USA)
@file Rayman 3 - Hoodlum Havoc (U) (M3).gba
@game AYZE
@chip EEPROM
@frozen dingbat-bios,mgba,nba
@save skip: the game writes a save slot only when a level is finished; quitting from the pause menu (done here) writes just the settings (15 bytes) and the slot list still reads EMPTY x3 on a reload. Level 1 (Forgotten Forest) was not finished: past the first ledge Rayman stops at the root cave and no input moved him on in two sessions.

# Intro skipped, title, English, Single Player, first slot, story text
# skipped into level 1: run right, jump onto the first ledge (first lum),
# drop down, pause > QUIT > YES back to the main menu.
# Findings: the three emulators are a frame or two apart from the intro on
# (f600 Murfy's wing animation differs on all three; "PRESS START" shows
# on dingbat-bios and nba at f844 but not on mgba). In the live session the
# decorative butterflies in level 1 sat in different places on each (f1974);
# the frozen replay shows level1 and first_lum identical on all three.
# nba writes an 8 KB EEPROM file, the others 512 bytes.
[new]
wait 600
press START hold=10
wait 200
# until text 'PRESS START' timeout=600 every=10  [reached dingbat-bios+10 mgba+10 nba+0]
wait 14
wait 20
checkpoint title window=30 compare=text
press START hold=10
wait 120
checkpoint language window=30
press A hold=10
wait 180
checkpoint main_menu window=30 compare=text
press A hold=10
wait 120
checkpoint slots window=30 compare=text
press A hold=10
wait 120
checkpoint story_text window=30
press START hold=10
wait 240
checkpoint level1 window=30 compare=none
press START hold=10
wait 60
checkpoint pause window=30 compare=text
press A hold=10
wait 30
press RIGHT hold=90
press RIGHT hold=120
hold RIGHT
press A hold=15
wait 60
release
hold RIGHT
wait 60
press A hold=15
wait 45
press A hold=15
wait 45
release
wait 60
checkpoint first_lum window=30 compare=none
press START hold=10
wait 60
press DOWN hold=10
wait 20
press DOWN hold=10
wait 20
press A hold=10
wait 120
press UP hold=10
wait 20
checkpoint quit_prompt window=30 compare=text
press A hold=10
wait 300
checkpoint after_quit window=30 compare=text
